d 'ELECDISP': module to calculate election disproportionality indices
d
d   elecdisp calculates six disproportionality indices for one or
d more elections: the Rae index, Adjusted Rae index,
d Loosemore–Hanby index, Adjusted Loosemore–Hanby index,
d Two-Major-Parties index, and Gallagher index. The command accepts
d vote and seat shares expressed as percentages or proportions and
d supports numeric and string election identifiers. 
d
d KW: electionss
d KW: disproportionality
d
d Requires: Stata version 19.5
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261112
d
d Author: Oscar Martínez Coello,  University of Mannheim
d Support: email oscar.martinez.coello@@uni-mannheim.de
d
f elecdisp.ado
f elecdisp.sthlp
f elecdisp_example.do
